{"id":"0a54c047-49cf-4817-812e-a22ec4e3581d","revision":0,"last_node_id":5889,"last_link_id":20416,"nodes":[{"id":99,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[-720,80],"size":[660,420],"flags":{},"order":0,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"title":"Read Me","properties":{"ue_properties":{"widget_ue_connectable":{},"version":"7.8","input_ue_unconnectable":{}}},"widgets_values":["## MiniMax H3 - single image (ref2va)\n\nRuns the ref2va path with `length = 5` (the minimum block), then keeps **one** frame via *Get Image or Mask Range From Batch* (`num_frames = 1`) and previews it. No audio VAE decode, no video save.\n\n### Models expected\n```\nComfyUI/models/\n  diffusion_models/10Eros_Max_h3_TURBO-hybrid_beta3_int8_convrot.safetensors\n  text_encoders/qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3_int8_convrot.safetensors\n  vae/minimax_h3_video_vae_int8_convrot.safetensors\n  vae/minimax_h3_audio_vae_fp32.safetensors\n```\nAudio VAE is still required as an input on the H3 node even though nothing decodes audio.\n\n### Custom node\n*Get Image or Mask Range From Batch* comes from **ComfyUI-KJNodes** (install via Manager). Swap for `ImageFromBatch` (comfy-core, batch_index 0 / length 1) if you'd rather not install it.\n\n### Notes\n- `width/height` must be multiples of 32. 1920x1088 is well above H3's native 768 short edge - drop to ~1344x768 if you get artifacts or OOM.\n- `length` steps in units of 17 (5, 22, 39...). Keep 5 for stills.\n- Steps 8 + `sa_solver` assumes a TURBO/distilled checkpoint. Use ~20 steps on a non-turbo model."],"widgets_values_named":{"text":"## MiniMax H3 - single image (ref2va)\n\nRuns the ref2va path with `length = 5` (the minimum block), then keeps **one** frame via *Get Image or Mask Range From Batch* (`num_frames = 1`) and previews it. No audio VAE decode, no video save.\n\n### Models expected\n```\nComfyUI/models/\n  diffusion_models/10Eros_Max_h3_TURBO-hybrid_beta3_int8_convrot.safetensors\n  text_encoders/qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3_int8_convrot.safetensors\n  vae/minimax_h3_video_vae_int8_convrot.safetensors\n  vae/minimax_h3_audio_vae_fp32.safetensors\n```\nAudio VAE is still required as an input on the H3 node even though nothing decodes audio.\n\n### Custom node\n*Get Image or Mask Range From Batch* comes from **ComfyUI-KJNodes** (install via Manager). Swap for `ImageFromBatch` (comfy-core, batch_index 0 / length 1) if you'd rather not install it.\n\n### Notes\n- `width/height` must be multiples of 32. 1920x1088 is well above H3's native 768 short edge - drop to ~1344x768 if you get artifacts or OOM.\n- `length` steps in units of 17 (5, 22, 39...). Keep 5 for stills.\n- Steps 8 + `sa_solver` assumes a TURBO/distilled checkpoint. Use ~20 steps on a non-turbo model."},"color":"#432","bgcolor":"#653"},{"id":5879,"type":"aef0f247-5852-4970-a75c-442249d27d06","pos":[20,80],"size":[360,170],"flags":{},"order":1,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"name":"unet_name","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"unet_name"},"link":null},{"name":"clip_name","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"clip_name"},"link":null},{"name":"vae_name","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"vae_name"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"MODEL","name":"MODEL","type":"MODEL","links":[20400]},{"localized_name":"CLIP","name":"CLIP","type":"CLIP","links":[20396]},{"localized_name":"VAE","name":"VAE","type":"VAE","links":[20397,20398]},{"localized_name":"VAE_1","name":"VAE_1","type":"VAE","links":[20399]}],"properties":{"cnr_id":"comfy-core","ver":"0.37.0","previewExposures":[],"ue_properties":{"widget_ue_connectable":{"unet_name":true,"clip_name":true,"vae_name":true},"version":"7.8","input_ue_unconnectable":{}}},"widgets_values":["minmaxh3/Minimax-h3_Singularity_ref2va_Pruned_v1.3_int8.safetensors","text_encoders/qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3_int8_convrot.safetensors","vae/minimax_h3_video_vae_int8_convrot.safetensors"],"widgets_values_named":{"unet_name":"minmaxh3/Minimax-h3_Singularity_ref2va_Pruned_v1.3_int8.safetensors","clip_name":"text_encoders/qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3_int8_convrot.safetensors",